:: MP Jobline Gwylan 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Docks">><</if>>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>把一张破网摊在栈桥木板上，网脚被礁石割开一道整齐的口子。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>用梭子挑起断线，朝你抬了抬下巴。
「不是鱼咬的，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>说，「是刀。昨晚有人从外礁过来，顺手割了我的网。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<mpsewicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<link [[帮格威岚补网 (0:08)|MP Jobline Gwylan 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineGwylan to Math.max(($mpJoblineGwylan or 0), 2)>><<pass 8>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<money 250>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[帮格威岚补网 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "帮格威岚补网">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">帮格威岚补网 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<link [[问昨晚看见谁 (0:05)|MP Jobline Gwylan 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineGwylan to Math.max(($mpJoblineGwylan or 0), 2)>><<pass 5>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJoblineGwylanClue to 1>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[问昨晚看见谁 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "问昨晚看见谁">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($money or 0) gte 200>><<walkicon>><<link [[买新网线 (0:06)|MP Jobline Gwylan 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineGwylan to Math.max(($mpJoblineGwylan or 0), 2)>><<pass 6>><<money -200>><<set $mpJoblineGwylanNet to 1>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">买新网线 (0:06)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Jobline Gwylan 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineGwylan to Math.max(($mpJoblineGwylan or 0), 3)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Docks">><</if>>
夜潮退到外礁，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>提着一盏蒙布的风灯站在礁脊上。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>指向两块黑礁之间的水面：「我的网昨晚就是在那儿被割的。水底下有东西，不像鱼。」
<<if $mpJoblineGwylanNet is 1>>
	你带来的新网线缠在<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>手腕上，灯一照，线头泛着干净的白色。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<swimicon>><<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 260>><<link [[潜到黑礁之间摸索 (0:08)|MP Jobline Gwylan 3]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineGwylanClue to 1>><<money 300>><<stress -2>><<else>><<pain 2>><<stress 4>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[潜到黑礁之间摸索 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "潜到黑礁之间摸索">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "游泳等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link [[找割网刀痕 (0:07)|MP Jobline Gwylan 3]]>><<pass 7>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineGwylanClue to 1>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[找割网刀痕 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "找割网刀痕">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<mpfishicon>><<link [[劝格威岚收网 (0:05)|MP Jobline Gwylan 3]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -2>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">劝格威岚收网 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP Jobline Gwylan 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineGwylan to 3>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Docks">><</if>>
<<if $mpJoblineGwylanClue is 1>>
	黑礁之间卡着一只没有标记的防水袋。袋口缠着割断的网线，里面是几卷用油纸包好的私货和一截断刀。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>看了一眼，没有伸手。
	「这东西不能留在我的网里，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>说，「你打算怎么办？」
<<else>>
	你们在礁石上找到半截断刀和几段被割断的网线。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>把刀踢进水里，脸色不太好看。
	「今晚先收网，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>说，「明天再来看。」
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[交给格威岚 (0:05)|MP Jobline Gwylan 4]]>><<set $mpJoblineGwylan to 4>><<pass 5>><<money 400>><<stress -3>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 2>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">交给格威岚 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[留下防水袋 (0:05)|MP Jobline Gwylan 4]]>><<set $mpJoblineGwylan to 4>><<pass 5>><<set $mpJoblineGwylanKeep to 1>><<money 700>><<stress 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[比对网线断口 (0:04)|MP Jobline Gwylan 4]]>><<set $mpJoblineGwylan to 4>><<pass 4>><<set $mpJoblineGwylanClue to 1>><<stress -2>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Gwylan 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineGwylan to 4>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Docks">><</if>>
第二天下午，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>在鱼档后面给你留了一只小木箱。箱里是晒好的鱼干、一卷新网线和一小袋盐。
<<if $mpJoblineGwylanKeep is 1>>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>没有提防水袋的事，只在你转身时说了句：「昨晚的风向不对。以后别一个人去外礁。」
<<else>>
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>>格威岚<<else>>杂货店主<</if>>把木箱推到你手边：「下次潮退，你还来帮我看网吗？」
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[收下木箱 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<pass 3>><<stress -4>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Sera 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "High Street">><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把一只没有主人的银壳怀表推到你面前，表盖上刻着一个很小的「M」。
「送修的人三周没来取，」她说，「押金只够付零件。你替我看看，里面有没有名字。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>><<link [[拆开后盖拓下刻字 (0:06)|MP Jobline Sera 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineSera to Math.max(($mpJoblineSera or 0), 2)>><<pass 6>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineSeraClue to 1>><<money 300>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[拆开后盖拓下刻字 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拆开后盖拓下刻字">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<if ($english or 0) gte 240>><<link [[问送修人模样 (0:04)|MP Jobline Sera 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineSera to Math.max(($mpJoblineSera or 0), 2)>><<pass 4>><<if ($english or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpJoblineSeraClue to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[问送修人模样 (0:04)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "问送修人模样">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">问送修人模样 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($money or 0) gte 400>><<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[买下怀表 (0:04)|MP Jobline Sera 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineSera to Math.max(($mpJoblineSera or 0), 2)>><<pass 4>><<money -400>><<set $mpJoblineSeraBought to 1>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">买下怀表 (0:04)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Jobline Sera 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineSera to Math.max(($mpJoblineSera or 0), 3)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "High Street">><</if>>
表盖内侧刻着一行很小的字：『给玛拉，等雾散。』下面还有一枚被磨平的地址，只剩下「旧钟塔」三个字。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把放大镜放下，手指在柜台上轻轻敲了两下。
「玛拉，」她说，「这个名字我见过。不是这十年的事。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link [[取维修簿 (0:07)|MP Jobline Sera 3]]>><<set $mpJoblineSera to 3>><<set $mpJoblineSeraClue to 1>><<pass 7>><<if ($history or 0) gte 260>><<money 250>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[取维修簿 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "取维修簿">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<link [[问玛拉的事 (0:06)|MP Jobline Sera 3]]>><<set $mpJoblineSera to 3>><<set $mpJoblineSeraClue to 1>><<pass 6>><<stress -2>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<mpnpcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问玛拉的事 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP Jobline Sera 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineSera to 4>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "High Street">><</if>>
维修簿上记着二十年前的一只怀表，送修人签名是「M. W.」，取表日期那一栏空着。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把簿子合上，沉默了一会儿。
「表你留着吧，」她说，「押金我退你。要是哪天有人来问，就说没见过。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[留下怀表 (0:04)|_exitPas]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<set $mpJoblineSera to 4>><<pass 4>><<money 500>><<stress -3>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>><<mpnpcincr Sera love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[带走怀表 (0:04)|_exitPas]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<set $mpJoblineSera to 4>><<pass 4>><<set $mpJoblineSeraKeep to 1>><<stress 1>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Alex 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Farmland")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Farmland">><</if>>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>在谷仓梁上摸出一只铁皮盒，盒里是一叠发黄的佃租收据。最上面那张的租额被红笔改过三次，最后一次的签名不是<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>。
「这块地以前不是我的，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>说，「我买下来的时候，上一任说收据都烧了。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回田埂 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link [[整理收据 (0:07)|MP Jobline Alex 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineAlex to Math.max(($mpJoblineAlex or 0), 2)>><<pass 7>><<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineAlexClue to 1>><<money 250>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[整理收据 (0:07)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "整理收据">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 7>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<link [[问前任的事 (0:05)|MP Jobline Alex 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineAlex to Math.max(($mpJoblineAlex or 0), 2)>><<pass 5>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineAlexClue to 1>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[问前任的事 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "问前任的事">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">问前任的事 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP Jobline Alex 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineAlex to Math.max(($mpJoblineAlex or 0), 3)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Farmland")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Farmland">><</if>>
收据背面记着一笔从未缴清的「水渠份子钱」。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把纸翻过来，指着最下面一行：「这条水渠早就不从我家地里过了，可账上还在收。」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把铁锹往地上一插：「今晚要下雨。你要是有空，帮我把西边那条旧渠挖开，看看水到底往哪儿走。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回谷仓 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<if ($physique or 0) gte 8000 or ($athletics or 0) gte 280>><<link [[挖开旧渠 (0:09)|MP Jobline Alex 3]]>><<set $mpJoblineAlex to 3>><<pass 9>><<if ($physique or 0) gte 8000 or ($athletics or 0) gte 280>><<set $mpJoblineAlexClue to 1>><<money 350>><<stress 2>><<else>><<pain 2>><<stress 5>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[挖开旧渠 (0:09)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "挖开旧渠">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：8000 或 运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 9>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
