<<else>><<link [[查看石标 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "查看石标">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Jobline Alex 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineAlex to 4>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Farmland")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Farmland">><</if>>
旧渠底下埋着一截被石头压住的木管，管口通向邻地。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>蹲下去看了很久，把铁锹横在膝上。
「水是从他们地里接过来的，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>说，「怪不得这些年我的井一直不够用。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回田埂 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<link [[劝他找佃租官 (0:05)|MP Jobline Alex 4]]>><<set $mpJoblineAlex to 4>><<pass 5>><<money 300>><<stress -2>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 2>><</if>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">劝他找佃租官 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[埋好木管 (0:05)|MP Jobline Alex 4]]>><<set $mpJoblineAlex to 4>><<pass 5>><<set $mpJoblineAlexQuiet to 1>><<stress -1>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[截断木管 (0:06)|MP Jobline Alex 4]]>><<set $mpJoblineAlex to 4>><<pass 6>><<set $mpJoblineAlexCut to 1>><<money 450>><<stress 3>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Alex 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineAlex to 4>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Farmland")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Farmland">><</if>>
雨停后，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>把第一捆新麦放在你脚边，麦芒上还挂着水珠。
<<if $mpJoblineAlexCut is 1>>
	「明年这条渠归我，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>说，「你要是还想来帮忙，我给你留一块地。」
<<elseif $mpJoblineAlexQuiet is 1>>
	「先不闹大，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>说，「但账我记着。你今晚帮了我大忙。」
<<else>>
	「官面上的人明天来，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>说，「你一起来吧。有些话你说比我管用。」
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回田埂 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpfarmicon>><<link [[收下麦捆 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<pass 3>><<money 200>><<stress -4>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Alex")>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Jobline Jordan 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Spa")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Spa">><</if>>
池边的石凳上落着一张被蒸汽浸软的祷词卡。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>捡起来，看了一眼就递给你。
「不是我们神殿的格式，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>说，「但字是真的。你认得出来吗？」
<br><br>
