<<else>><<link [[收拢祷词卡 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "收拢祷词卡">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<link [[问卡是谁的 (0:04)|MP Jobline Jordan 2]]>><<set $mpJoblineJordan to Math.max(($mpJoblineJordan or 0), 2)>><<pass 4>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineJordanClue to 1>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[问卡是谁的 (0:04)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "问卡是谁的">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">问卡是谁的 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP Jobline Jordan 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineJordan to Math.max(($mpJoblineJordan or 0), 3)>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Spa")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Spa">><</if>>
祷词卡的背面用铅笔写着七个名字，最后一个被水泡得只剩半个。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把卡翻过来，指腹在第一个名字上停了停。
「这个人我认识，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>说，「上个月来过。他说他在等一个人，等到雾散就走。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回池边 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<link [[整理池边名册 (0:06)|MP Jobline Jordan 3]]>><<set $mpJoblineJordan to 3>><<pass 6>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineJordanClue to 1>><<money 300>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><</if>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[整理池边名册 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "整理池边名册">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">整理池边名册 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>><<link [[查看那格柜子 (0:06)|MP Jobline Jordan 3]]>><<set $mpJoblineJordan to 3>><<pass 6>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpJoblineJordanClue to 1>><<stress -1>><<else>><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[查看那格柜子 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "查看那格柜子">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Jobline Jordan 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "spa">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineJordan to 4>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Spa")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Spa">><</if>>
<<if $mpJoblineJordanClue is 1>>
	登记簿上那个名字后面画着一个很小的圈，备注栏写着「等人，未归」。柜子里只有一条叠好的干净毛巾和一枚旧铜钥匙。
	<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把钥匙收进袖口：「剩下的我来查。你别再一个人进蒸汽房了。」
<<else>>
	你们没找到更多东西。<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>>乔丹<<else>>神殿修士<</if>>把祷词卡折好，放回石凳上：「也许他还会回来。」
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回池边 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<link [[陪乔丹关池 (0:04)|_exitPas]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<set $mpJoblineJordan to 4>><<pass 4>><<money 350>><<stress -4>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan love 1>><</if>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">陪乔丹关池 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

