<<else>><<link [[拆下旧绣标 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拆下旧绣标">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
