<<else>><<link [[问贝利说了什么 (0:04)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "问贝利说了什么">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>
