:: MP Jobline Robin 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJoblineRobin to 4>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Orphanage")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Orphanage">><</if>>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>把衬衫叠好，没有放回洗衣篮，而是压在自己床垫下面。
「玛拉以前住这间，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>说，「她走的时候，也留了一件衣服。贝利把它烧了。」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>抬头看你：「这件先别交上去。行吗？」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回走廊 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[答应藏着 (0:04)|_exitPas]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<set $mpJoblineRobin to 4>><<pass 4>><<money 200>><<stress -4>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><</if>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">答应藏着 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[抄下收据 (0:05)|_exitPas]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<set $mpJoblineRobin to 4>><<pass 5>><<set $mpJoblineRobinClue to 1>><<stress -1>><</link>>

